      "message": "We are honoring server\u0027s the \"max\" transport_latency. If we have to accommodate the \"preferred\" RTN (which is higher than the client\u0027s RTN), then indirectly we may be accepting to support a higher transport latency. Hence our preference is to stick with the client QoS parameters as long as the Max_Transport_Latency of the server is greater than or equal our preferred Max_Transport_Latency.",
